  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Demining for Peace and Security in the Fergana Valley</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project corresponds to FCDO project numbers PEA ISFD REE 0413001 (ODA allocation &#xa3;220,000) and 0413002 (NODA allocation &#xa3;350,000).

This project aims to foster peace, security and stability in the region. By deploying a gender-balanced and gender-responsive multitask team specialised in Explosive Ordnance Risk Education (EORE) and Explosive Ordnance Disposal (EOD)/Battle Area Clearance (BAC), the project seeks to achieve the alleviation of socio-economic impact of landmines and ERW contamination on women, girls, boys and men along the Tajik-Kyrgyz and the Tajik-Uzbek borders.</narrative>
  </description>
